  "question": {
    "text": "A plane electromagnetic wave of wavelength <math><mi>&#955;</mi></math> has an intensity <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi></math>. It is propagating along the positive <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>-</mo></math>direction. The allowed expressions for the electric and magnetic fields are given by:"
  },
